有老年痴呆症，夫妇俩怕李祥勤出门走丢，所以将门窗锁死。结果家中煤气泄漏，李祥勤打电话给儿子李诚求救，但李诚在陪老丈人喝酒，并未听完李祥勤的话就将电话挂断，李祥勤只得给女儿李静打去求救电话。女儿此时在机场即将登机出差，发现父亲在李诚家煤气中毒后，连忙联系李诚想要李诚回去救人。","series_id":"7457421394494622782","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"2026110623571857054ED71A8377947AE5\",\"rank\":\"9\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7457421394494622782\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.021440042182803154,\\\"finish\\\":0.049589015543460846,\\\"collect\\\":0.04885777458548546,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":1.1840553283691406,\\\"like\\\":0.08269734680652618,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.2825809717178345,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.2079802006483078}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7457421394494622782","play_cnt":653912,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"树下的椰子","sub_title":"家庭·家庭伦理","score":"8.3","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":54,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5001,\"name\":\"家庭\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5001&categoryName=家庭&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5047,\"name\":\"家庭伦理\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5047&categoryName=家庭伦理&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5176,\"name\":\"虐渣\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5176&categoryName=虐渣&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5180,\"name\":\"反转\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5180&categoryName=反转&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5174,\"name\":\"矛盾和解\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5174&categoryName=矛盾和解&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5206,\"name\":\"总裁\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5206&categoryName=总裁&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5338,\"name\":\"现代\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://